" <F11> and <F12> are complementary.  They each select the current
" paragraph, operate on it and advance to the next paragraph.  
"	<F11> breaks the lines by passing it through 'fmt'
" map	<F11>	{jV}k!fmt<CR>}j  Need Unix for 'fmt' -- just use 'gq' command
map	<F11>	{jV}kgq}j
"	<F12> joins the paragraph into one line for pasting into X text fields
" BETTER: set linebreak + autoindent to *display* wraparound, but text
" is still on one line.
